1. CIDR SUBNETTING CHEATSHEET
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/24 -> 256 IPs  (254 hosts) | Mask: 255.255.255.0
/25 -> 128 IPs  (126 hosts) | Mask: 255.255.255.128
/26 -> 64 IPs   (62 hosts)  | Mask: 255.255.255.192
/27 -> 32 IPs   (30 hosts)  | Mask: 255.255.255.224
/28 -> 16 IPs   (14 hosts)  | Mask: 255.255.255.240

2. TCP THREE-WAY HANDSHAKE & TEARDOWN
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Connection Establishment:
  Client                     Server
    | ---- SYN (seq=x) ---->   |
    | <--- SYN-ACK (ack=x+1) - |
    | ---- ACK (ack=y+1) --->  |

Connection Teardown:
  Client sends FIN -> Server sends ACK -> Server sends FIN -> Client sends ACK.

3. SLIDING WINDOW & FLOW CONTROL
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Go-Back-N (GBN): Sender can transmit up to N unacknowledged frames.
  Sender window size = 2^k - 1. Receiver window size = 1.
- Selective Repeat (SR): Both sender and receiver maintain window size = 2^(k-1).
